Package: rox-filer2
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: josejp2424 <puppylinuxjosejp2424@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: libc6, libglib2.0-0t64 | libglib2.0-0, libgtk-3-0t64 | libgtk-3-0, libxml2, shared-mime-info
Recommends: libgtk-layer-shell0
Provides: rox-filer, file-manager
Conflicts: rox-filer
Replaces: rox-filer
Homepage: https://github.com/josejp2424/ROX-Filer-gtk3
Description: Rox-Filer2 lightweight GTK3 file manager and desktop
 Rox-Filer2 continues the original ROX-Filer as a fast GTK3 file manager.
 This build includes the Rox-Filer2 Desktop, wallpaper management, desktop applications,
 drive icons, paired filer windows, the native ROX File Search companion,
 standard XDG MIME associations, user applications, custom actions, trash support and templates.
